# Saddle Tramp

**Alignments.** Any, but the vast majority tend to be selfish.

The Saddle Tramp is the nomadic vagabond of the New West. They like to think of
themselves as free-spirited Jacks-of-all-trades who ride where the wind blows
and stop wherever they please. In fact most are uneducated drifters born of
peasants or bandits, with no formal education and minimal training in any
trade, and most are self-serving opportunists.

What separates them from bandits is narrow but real: most do not actively rob
or commit crimes, most do not deliberately hurt people, and most are too lazy
to put in the work of being an outlaw.

They like adventure and travel and do not much mind sleeping in a barn or under
the stars when their luck is out, which it usually is. They also love the good
life and spend money like water whenever they have any. The Saddle Tramp''s
dream is enough money for fine clothes, the best hotels, good liquor and
regular gambling - one big deal that sets him up for the rest of his life.

## Lore

Also known as the Drifter and the Scalawag.
